WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:03.924
Unit seventeen. Online Privacy!

2
00:00:04.893 --> 00:00:08.542
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:12.244
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.294 --> 00:00:16.087
Today we learn about Online Privacy. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:21.000
Privacy. Say it with me. Privacy!

6
00:00:24.485 --> 00:00:28.002
Password. Say it with me. Password!

7
00:00:31.511 --> 00:00:36.061
Personal information. Say it with me. Personal information!

8
00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:43.397
Settings. Say it with me. Settings!

9
00:00:46.892 --> 00:00:50.625
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

10
00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:58.025
Location. Say it with me. Location!

11
00:01:01.525 --> 00:01:05.475
Screenshot. Say it with me. Screenshot!

12
00:01:08.983 --> 00:01:12.533
Report. Say it with me. Report!

13
00:01:16.025 --> 00:01:28.749
Protecting my privacy online means using strong passwords and private settings. I do not share personal information or my location with a stranger. I report anything unsafe.

14
00:01:28.799 --> 00:01:30.307
I can do that too!

15
00:01:31.586 --> 00:01:36.757
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:36.807 --> 00:01:38.456
Personal information!

17
00:01:39.403 --> 00:01:44.567
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.617 --> 00:01:45.767
Screenshot!

19
00:01:46.826 --> 00:01:53.077
Did you know? Photos can contain location information, so be careful what you post!

20
00:01:53.127 --> 00:01:55.150
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:55.850 --> 00:02:03.916
Think and answer. What privacy settings could you check today?

22
00:02:03.966 --> 00:02:05.116
Great answer!

23
00:02:06.178 --> 00:02:11.134
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:11.184 --> 00:02:13.772
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

